{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "df708dc9f810af75d94d15726feb9e2e0d633ddf84f3ea817746401a0ebcbaa3", "ja": "楽しくて、大切で、大好き", "zh": "快乐、珍贵、最喜欢", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "46554c7a7eab58a0433edb3ee5411c6e4eddae3efa59ce5aeef10b07f3ee3b9a", "ja": "ライブ終了後は、遊園地のご褒美が待って\nいた。充実感とともに互いを認めあい、\n改めて絆を強めた6人は遊園地を満喫する。\nトラブルを味方につける力強いバトンが、\nTeam5thへと引き継がれ……。", "zh": "演出结束后，游乐园的奖励正在等待着他们。带着充实感，互相认可彼此，再次加深羁绊的6人尽情享受着游乐园。\n将困境化为助力的有力接力棒，传递到了Team5th手中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "620884d652166c5b91c421e63a667e8777b6c8a5a361c6f8ba5a22bde23dd5c4", "ja": "メインステージでのライブ終了後……", "zh": "主舞台上的演出结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "09e5d276a6aab0643a944490ea7c711c34889a34639951732698f05f5cb8a163", "ja": "さて、ライブも大成功に終わったところで……\nこの後はお楽しみの、遊園地ね♪", "zh": "那么，演唱会也圆满成功了……\n接下来就是令人期待的游乐园啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "f16b011445b876029c762ee132a269df17e19c17d1fc029ea73596b9b3ff1a58", "ja": "はぁぁぁっ！　ま、まさかアイドルちゃん達と\n遊園地で遊べるなんて……ご褒美が過ぎますよぉ！", "zh": "哈啊啊啊！没、没想到竟然能和偶像们一起去游乐园玩……这奖励也太丰厚了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "805d956ca41485ca1eacf0c7c54cddbc2f814aea5cc3b4b4936ad69938be7868", "ja": "あら。じゃあ、やめとく？", "zh": "哎呀。那，要不算了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "9fa62064f8d2b885210e15de2d8cb3ce5af43a56918f2f0620118a70cbf93a88", "ja": "後生ですからやめないでください！\nそれに、ライブが成功したのは……", "zh": "求求你千万不要放弃！\n而且，演出之所以能成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "847a9a0503a9e0180a8c7dfeb19e3b54eb19ef12d680f6c8d2497219bbcc4d6b", "ja": "桃子ちゃんセンパイがレッスンを見てくれた\nおかげですから……無駄にはできません！", "zh": "都是因为桃子前辈帮我指导了训练……不能白费！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "ee462f8c3a02052a46fe1298fa7759598b7378257925354749f9bd3b7fd1be02", "ja": "うん。亜利沙さんは、最初写真ばっかり撮って\n遅れ気味だったもんね。", "zh": "嗯。因为亜利沙姐一开始光顾着拍照，进度都有点落后了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "852a68f884957dcc538312bf34b6166fff64dba671a6a09a1fd4b17331190b15", "ja": "ぐはぁっ！？", "zh": "呜哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "8807029aa1df733af9a3d564ccad9a38268ef1b5da717d2f57550a99ca1c2b3b", "ja": "わたくし達も桃子ちゃんのおかげで苦手の発見や克服が\nスムーズにできましたものね。心強かったですわ。", "zh": "我们也多亏了桃子，才能顺利发现并克服自己的弱项呢。真是让人安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "49e26917ed1544c28ea642d4bdc138cf7c06d85c2734a4185617d76c5060ea32", "ja": "かなり厳しかったもんなぁ、桃子のチェック。\n遊園地への本気度が伝わってきたわ。", "zh": "桃子的检查可严格了啊。能看出来她对游乐园有多认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "8beabd17e0d746059d5eda61bdd67bcd0c371d56b4b628e75cfd4df9d5838b46", "ja": "べ、別に遊園地で遊びたかったわけじゃなくてっ。\n厳しくしないと、みんな言うこと聞かないからでしょ！", "zh": "我、我才不是想去游乐园玩呢。\n不严格一点的话，大家根本不会听话嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "e4ed6c613b7973fd362fc6af6ecd8baf340bfb20628efe835b0d18277118709b", "ja": "このチーム、いつも騒がしいし、みんな好き勝手に\n動いちゃうんだもん。……遅刻も多いし。", "zh": "这个团队总是吵吵闹闹的，大家还总是想做什么就做什么。……而且经常迟到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "a2a99943be454e1302a5365427e5be7e5f40f5019e161f58e937d482fe0d88bb", "ja": "うっ。た、確かにロコは、ミーティングを\nフォーゲットしてしまったこともありました……。", "zh": "唔。确、确实ROCO也曾有把\n会议给忘记了的时候……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "d6c71fffd123138e206a39786d3a42bbaeff240e94528411e574baea281d50ce", "ja": "遅刻はよくありませんものね。\n……でも、ほら、あちらをご覧くださいな。", "zh": "迟到可不是什么好事呢。\n……不过，您看，请看那边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "12413d2635166a1f20663b620112d06832f032bdaf9335fe74a590ecaf319b31", "ja": "あっ、あそこ！　メリーゴーラウンド乗ってる人、\n私らのライブT着てくれてるやん！", "zh": "啊，看那里！坐旋转木马的人，穿着我们的演唱会T恤呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "177fc6d153b1a58917018a6ae1f1249b281d04513592dcd7698c6fdaf976e705", "ja": "！　ロコも見つけました！\nペアでコーデしてくれてますね！", "zh": "！我也找到ROCO了！你们还搭配成情侣装了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "e805f64db521a799d42f86e3a1ba09e99d67a3c27a42647dbdd7c3cc61979ce0", "ja": "ライブTのアイディアは、桃子もすごくいいと思ったよ\n……その……別に企画として、とかじゃなくて。", "zh": "演唱会T恤的主意，桃子也觉得特别好哦……那个……不是因为这是企划什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "e37b95b3d43b39c4c6f582c3bae6926acc4e50cbff4deee837fcbb1b25c7077e", "ja": "ロコさんが、チームのこと大切に考えてくれてるんだ、\nって……わかったから。", "zh": "因为桃子明白了，ROCO先生是真心把团队放在心上的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "5a3cb74a8a1af977ef39cd2b79ac8ee349d85b36e6348f5568b60d586fa9351b", "ja": "モモコ……。", "zh": "桃子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "5b67347257f0d0f918f4b594176520f61c3a27b6b6c428506753181662b7dc28", "ja": "あれは間違いなくコロちゃんのお手柄ですわ。\n堂々と胸を張ってくださいまし！", "zh": "那毫无疑问是小罗可的功劳。请堂堂正正地挺起胸膛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "0e74d8b7e4bfed1987c6743f8b825c5c1c6ee300d6208783a637a9048d5e0627", "ja": "えへへ、サンクスです♪\nでもロコはロコです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢♪不过，ROCO是ROCO哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "97131fe4c1adbd1e1a7ac6499539b85308f777fdc25af6b917fdd78c6795ada2", "ja": "ウフフ♪　自然とチームもまとまって……\n今回お姉さんの出番はあんまりなかったかしらね？", "zh": "呵呵♪ 队伍也自然而然地团结起来了……\n这次好像没怎么轮到姐姐出场呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "66e97b5a276abd06f94d8082aaca1c519b21f376d0928bfc0c63a9e93afde19e", "ja": "え？　ずっと、ありがたかったですケド？", "zh": "诶？一直都很感谢你呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "644321adf50c43bc607a185f32112f595e0c29a74d10145979f267cf906de5b3", "ja": "ステージで、いっぱい頑張って、\n桃子たちを引っ張ってくれたでしょ？", "zh": "你在舞台上一直努力，还带领桃子她们一路走过来了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "8dda361984069bb6817dc0e741696128cbcf876951abbcdef39a24d5d3a62a82", "ja": "せやな。パフォーマンスでも引っ張ってくれたけど\nそれだけやなくて……。", "zh": "没错。你不仅在舞台表演上带领了大家，\n还不只是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "b2cce2055eacae7de47e3f3a6f1bdea919c1687266733a6ac52f9bbb2791992a", "ja": "隣からも、背中からも。歌ってるコノミの\nマインドが聞こえて来るみたいでしたよ♪", "zh": "不管是从旁边，还是从背后。感觉连唱歌的木实的心情都能听见似的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "49940ece9ac895b120d001bbcf1bdc3aa05627523ffa822bb50c4a77d19a4dcb", "ja": "ええ。……「うれしい」って！", "zh": "对……是“开心”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "5b3009f8cd12ac17ae944ba6dc14f3e8b71f8f297a8af5e9cc933ccb1d9e2a54", "ja": "「うれしい」……。", "zh": "“开心”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "932d812da49bb739049fc8dcc830e38467a10e8194a50c030664a65a88aad806", "ja": "Team4thは人数も多くて、みなさんのお人柄も\n雰囲気も趣味も、いろいろですケド……。", "zh": "Team4th的人数很多，大家的人品、\n氛围和兴趣也都各不相同，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "7930b3f08592297fc41b26d7b9a46c787e2f1a929a788dd805150fa1deb60ccb", "ja": "きっと、ステージに立ちたい気持ちは、\nみんな一緒なんです。……その、ありさも含めて。", "zh": "大家一定都怀着登上舞台的心情。……那个，也包括亚利沙在内。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "aaa88cf21d9471c38576a3ba876800f97a25952b11cf1cd0cd9b7d3411e99e5c", "ja": "それをこのみさんは、\nすごく思い出させてくれて……。", "zh": "这让这个美子小姐深深地想起了那份心情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "d52c49762635ce9ab797bc0589b8500bd42a35880c3ad9407912a255f09efcd0", "ja": "ありさはずっと、助けてもらってました。\nきっと、みなさんも！", "zh": "亚利沙一直都在受您的帮助。\n大家肯定也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "de10ccb0bafc52125441a3d6d7ef586c003c0663b9521cba32be540f438914dd", "ja": "ステージか……。ふふっ、そうよね。", "zh": "舞台啊……呵呵，也对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "6fc3166b33c8cafe310e87dceb880e7cbd2f9ae6540ef2e440414439dcf40e27", "ja": "最初は勘違いで始まったアイドルだけど……\nでも、夢見ちゃったんだもの。", "zh": "虽然一开始是误打误撞才成为偶像的……\n但是，我已经做起梦来了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "30f24c78ef42b4f5e1884af7603c14df2f5739e53267563059db47cda77679df", "ja": "私、ステージで歌いたかったの。アイドルが好き……\n大好き。教えてくれてありがとう、みんな。", "zh": "我想在舞台上唱歌。我喜欢偶像……\n非常喜欢。谢谢大家告诉了我这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "2696de77f13c4ed97472fdd3de2fd6227f14c69519d99dd1c296122e71ee7004", "ja": "みんな、待たせて悪かった！\n最後のあいさつ回りが長引いちゃって……。", "zh": "大家，抱歉让你们久等了！\n最后去挨个打招呼花了不少时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1037_401pro", "source_sha256": "fa1affe9e75b8c9bf2d117af4028d8cb474070a1d503d5fab13a879edb2df90f", "ja": "予定通り、俺は荷物番をしてるから、みんな遊びに\nいって大丈夫。パレードも始まるらしいぞ！", "zh": "按计划，我会看着行李，所以大家放心去玩吧。听说游行也要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1038_038chz", "source_sha256": "9f177e156d2207f27b7d350697383f0d10157536d48017195a6473c5f91e710e", "ja": "では。せっかくですから、見ていきましょうか。\n……パレードは無料で観覧できますの？", "zh": "那么，难得有这个机会，我们去看看吧。\n……游行是可以免费观看的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1039_025roc", "source_sha256": "2d6125804965c441407c556594ac15886a0f02cec57c7d27d9dda15541bfdc15", "ja": "パレードも気になりますけど、ロコ的には\nさかさまのコーヒーカップがインタレスティングです！", "zh": "游行也很让人在意，不过对ROCO来说，倒转的咖啡杯更有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "84a05b0808b012446cca49a9c304dad0b07fcfa13da4be499a978c8f4d384baf", "ja": "乗り物なら、やっぱり絶叫マシンがええかな～。\nここ、そっち系も充実してるんやって！", "zh": "说到游乐设施，果然还是尖叫系的比较好吧～  \n听说这里那类设施也很丰富呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "29e57a1dd74382cb6ebdd3bfbcacbf9e0dbf5340bc6d1b625f35e6e45ec4274e", "ja": "乗り物は、順番を決めて効率よくまわらなきゃ。\nみんなでパンフレット、もらいに行こう！", "zh": "游乐设施得先安排好顺序，高效地玩才行。  \n我们一起去拿宣传册吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "f5912c50331a33da4f79e83d2517da04459cbbb35da14b3caf7dd0a786e541ff", "ja": "慌てなくても時間はたっぷりあるからな～！\n……さて。俺はちょっと仕事の続きを……。", "zh": "不用慌，时间还多着呢～！\n……好了，我先继续处理一下工作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0314_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0314_story_07_1043_401pro", "source_sha256": "56c16a18f99d6b91dbeb2851162672f1f4a4686b33954c92bd82f8313b4be383", "ja": "Team5thもいろいろあったからな……。\n今度こそ、ばっちり計画を立てておこう！", "zh": "Team5th也经历了不少事啊……\n这次一定要好好把计划做周全！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
